{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43530","headline":"三言拟五杂组联句 · 颜真卿","name":"三言拟五杂组联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五杂组，盘上葅。\n往复还，头嬾梳。\n不得已，罾里鱼。\n五杂组，郊外芜。\n往复还，枥上驹。\n不得已，谷中愚。\n五杂组，绣与锦。\n往复还，兴又寝。\n不得已，病伏枕。\n五杂组，酒与肉。\n往复还，东篱菊。\n不得已，醉便宿。\n五杂组，闤闠间。\n往复还，门上关。\n不得已，鬓毛斑。\n五杂组，绣纹线。\n往复还，春来燕。\n不得已，入征战。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43530.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43530","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}